name: Madness — boss-scaling mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  When Small or Big Blind is selected, Madness gains X0.5 Mult and destroys a random
  Joker. First-shop scaling: keep cheap/expandable fodder to the right (Egg, Riff-Raff)
  and protect key jokers with spacing or Eternal stickers.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Madness
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: RiffRaff
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Egg
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: AbstractJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
